{"v":1,"book":"gita","n":8,"title":"The eternal being, God","narrator":{"name":"Brian","voice":"en-US-BrianMultilingualNeural"},"duration":304.728,"scenes":[{"layout":"title","headline":"The Eternal Being","visual":["What we remember at the end"],"L":[],"say":"Chapter Eight. The Eternal Being. This chapter looks at the biggest moment of all: the end of a life, and what lies beyond it.","start":0.0,"at":0.576,"end":9.84,"words":[[0.05,0.45,"Chapter"],[0.512,0.3,"Eight"],[1.188,0.062,"The"],[1.262,0.5,"Eternal"],[1.775,0.438,"Being"],[2.587,0.15,"This"],[2.75,0.487,"chapter"],[3.25,0.3,"looks"],[3.562,0.113,"at"],[3.688,0.113,"the"],[3.812,0.362,"biggest"],[4.188,0.338,"moment"],[4.537,0.1,"of"],[4.65,0.35,"all"],[5.737,0.075,"the"],[5.825,0.225,"end"],[6.062,0.062,"of"],[6.138,0.062,"a"],[6.213,0.463,"life"],[6.7,0.15,"and"],[6.862,0.175,"what"],[7.05,0.325,"lies"],[7.388,0.375,"beyond"],[7.775,0.25,"it"]]},{"layout":"story","headline":"Seven questions","visual":["Who is the Eternal Being? What is karma?","Who are mortal beings and divine beings?","How are you known at the time of death?"],"L":[],"say":"Arjuna opens with a list of questions, almost like a student before an exam. Who is the Eternal Being? What is the Self? What is karma? Who are the mortal beings, and who are the divine? And how, at the moment of death, can you be known by those who have disciplined their minds?","start":9.84,"at":10.416,"end":29.376,"words":[[0.087,0.475,"Arjuna"],[0.575,0.5,"opens"],[1.087,0.163,"with"],[1.262,0.037,"a"],[1.312,0.325,"list"],[1.65,0.075,"of"],[1.738,0.6,"questions"],[2.362,0.35,"almost"],[2.725,0.138,"like"],[2.875,0.037,"a"],[2.925,0.512,"student"],[3.45,0.338,"before"],[3.8,0.062,"an"],[3.875,0.562,"exam"],[4.838,0.263,"Who"],[5.112,0.237,"is"],[5.362,0.075,"the"],[5.45,0.512,"Eternal"],[5.975,0.412,"Being"],[6.775,0.15,"What"],[6.938,0.2,"is"],[7.15,0.1,"the"],[7.263,0.562,"Self"],[8.213,0.113,"What"],[8.338,0.15,"is"],[8.5,0.562,"karma"],[9.475,0.287,"Who"],[9.7