,"What fills a life fills its last moment","So what we think about all day matters"],"L":["L1"],"say":"Lesson one. Whatever one thinks of at death, one attains. The state of the mind at the end shapes what comes next. And the last thought is not a lucky accident. Whatever fills a person's mind throughout life is what fills it at the end.","start":170.328,"at":170.904,"end":186.816,"words":[[0.062,0.35,"Lesson"],[0.425,0.375,"one"],[1.188,0.35,"Whatever"],[1.55,0.263,"one"],[1.825,0.312,"thinks"],[2.15,0.113,"of"],[2.275,0.138,"at"],[2.425,0.425,"death"],[2.862,0.263,"one"],[3.138,0.637,"attains"],[4.188,0.075,"The"],[4.275,0.4,"state"],[4.688,0.1,"of"],[4.8,0.087,"the"],[4.9,0.525,"mind"],[5.45,0.15,"at"],[5.612,0.062,"the"],[5.688,0.287,"end"],[5.987,0.438,"shapes"],[6.438,0.163,"what"],[6.612,0.263,"comes"],[6.888,0.512,"next"],[7.763,0.125,"And"],[7.9,0.1,"the"],[8.012,0.362,"last"],[8.387,0.325,"thought"],[8.738,0.163,"is"],[8.912,0.275,"not"],[9.2,0.075,"a"],[9.287,0.375,"lucky"],[9.675,0.625,"accident"],[10.675,0.338,"Whatever"],[11.025,0.35,"fills"],[11.387,0.075,"a"],[11.475,0.425,"person's"],[11.912,0.412,"mind"],[12.338,0.375,"throughout"],[12.725,0.362,"life"],[13.113,0.163,"is"],[13.287,0.188,"what"],[13.488,0.35,"fills"],[13.85,0.163,"it"],[14.025,0.138,"at"],[14.175,0.062,"the"],[14.25,0.438,"end"]]},{"layout":"lesson","headline":"Always Remember God While Doing Your Duty","visual":["Remember God at all times","And do your duty","Not ritual alone: constant remembrance"],"L":["L2"],"say":"Lesson two. Always remember God while doing your duty. This is the simple, reliable method. Keep the mind and intellect turned toward God while you work. Not ritual alone, and not withdrawal from life, but remembrance in the middle of it.","start":186.816,"at":187.392,"end":204.504,"words":[[0.062,0.338,"Lesson"],[0.412,0.375,"two"],[1.175,0.35,"Always"],[1.538,0.375,"remember"],[1.925,0.4,"God"],[2.337,0.237,"while"],[2.587,0.3,"doing"],[2.9,0.138,"your"],[3.05,0.45,"